($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18255158, $f$"Did you just come out of the oven? Because you're hot."$f$, ARRAY[$f$Clarissa_23$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$University student Wei Wuxian has a big crush on one of the waiters in a café near his campus. So with the support of his siblings, friends and the help of pick-up lines, he attempts to woo Lan Wangji.$f$, 1134, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-10-30T07:58:39.324+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-30T07:58:39.358+00:00$f$, $f$2019-03-27T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
