($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18270662, $f$A mess of strings$f$, ARRAY[$f$EonaSPN$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$When Shin Siyun accidently gets dragged into the world of cultivators, she sees the most messed up connections she has ever seen. After that she can never forget it as she watches them change over the years.$f$, 3414, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2019-11-04T04:43:21.238+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-04T04:43:21.289+00:00$f$, $f$2019-04-27T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18273719, $f$splendor hung aloft$f$, ARRAY[$f$spookyfoot$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$The coffin is too small for two people but death isn’t usually a pairs activity.
  Another wave hits, weaker than before but far more terrifying.  Ordinarily, Xie Lian would say his balance is pretty good, but it’s no match for the water around them. His hips pitch forward right where he doesn’t want them, pressing Hua Cheng against the side of the coffin and leaving him with nowhere to hide. Although he’s ascended to heaven three times this is the second his soul leaves his body. At least he’ll save Hua Cheng the trouble of finding Xie Lian a coffin now that he’s died of embarrassment.$f$, 2095, 1, 1, true, 5, false, $f$2019-10-13T03:18:43.056+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-13T03:18:43.084+00:00$f$, $f$2019-04-29T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18281618, $f$Thank You$f$, ARRAY[$f$maddy_angst$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$This fanfic is angst with a happy ending.AU where Mo Xuanyu finally gets some happiness. In this AU WWX is summoned by someone else and MXY lives. The story has its focus on his return from the LanLing Jin Sect.It is not before his summoning. In the present moment, Mo Xuanyu is 17 years old. In my headcanon, he summons Wei Wuxian around 24 years old. But my fanfic is a canon divergence based on my headcanons.Also it will include my OC, Gui He, who is a poet, a very kind-hearted person and he doesn't accept shit from anyone.I plan to write their adventures together.$f$, 5160, 4, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-11-03T20:41:04.438+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-03T20:41:04.451+00:00$f$, $f$2019-09-07T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18287039, $f$Measure Twice$f$, ARRAY[$f$Anonymous$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Original Work$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$or, An Old Friend
Zuran has worked as a courtesan in the Kolvan Lodge for several years. He prides himself on his expertise, and on keeping a regular clientele eager to come back for more. A man from his past shows up -- and changes everything. Feelings he'd buried and forgotten rise to haunt him, and start him on an unexpected path.$f$, 3692, 1, 1, true, 3, false, $f$2019-04-22T01:00:58.526+00:00$f$, $f$2019-04-22T01:00:58.589+00:00$f$, $f$2019-03-30T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18287105, $f$Cut Once$f$, ARRAY[$f$Anonymous$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Original Work$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$or, A Knight Errant
A friend told Mikash she'd seen a courtesan in Kolva who looked just like his old friend. When they'd served together, and been prisoners together, they'd been more than friends. It's been ten years, but Mikash has to go see the man. Maybe, if this courtesan will take him on as a patron, he can get some of those lingering feelings out of his system?$f$, 3904, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2019-04-22T01:38:55.528+00:00$f$, $f$2019-04-22T01:38:55.565+00:00$f$, $f$2019-03-30T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18287246, $f$Being Yourself, On Purpose$f$, ARRAY[$f$wyvernwood$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Original Work$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Part III of Measure Twice, Cut OnceZuran wakes up, not at the Kolvan Lodge where he works as a courtesan, but in the quarters of a visiting knight errant. Mikash and Zuran may have resolved the tensions that led to their separation, but they lead incompatible lives. Zuran sees no way they could stay together. Mikash sees no way he would let go.$f$, 6208, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2019-04-28T00:03:57.756+00:00$f$, $f$2019-04-28T00:03:57.759+00:00$f$, $f$2019-03-30T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18296270, $f$Living for this$f$, ARRAY[$f$SoftPupcake$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Call the Midwife$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$I actually wrote this for Tumblr on which I received a prompt and then another prompt after I wrote the first part about them finding out they are expecting. See beginning notes for the prompts.In short terms, Valucille finds out they are expecting and are going to be parents.$f$, 2115, 1, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-06-02T00:44:45.110+00:00$f$, $f$2019-06-02T00:44:45.119+00:00$f$, $f$2019-03-30T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
