($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18314078, $f$Life, after$f$, ARRAY[$f$Pippitypopadoo$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Mo Xuanyu dies. Wei Wuxian returns. Wei Wuxian saves lives. Wei Wuxian finds love.Mo Xuanyu is dead and the gods above don't even have the decency to let him move on.(A story where a lost and lonely soul finds another and eventually learns to heal.)$f$, 7658, 1, 1, true, 5, false, $f$2019-11-06T09:46:53.059+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-06T09:46:53.075+00:00$f$, $f$2019-04-01T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18326960, $f$月下红烛花暖怜$f$, ARRAY[$f$xiayi$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$花瓣，红伞，一拜天地，二拜父母，夫妻对拜，送入洞房~铺满了整个太苍山的血色花瓣，是属于这对新人的红地毯啊。$f$, 9742, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-10-13T11:55:29.018+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-13T11:55:29.040+00:00$f$, $f$2019-04-02T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18330167, $f$Not in Rivers, but in Drops$f$, ARRAY[$f$Naamah_Beherit$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Death was supposed to bring them peace.And for a while, it did. Hong Diao and his sons have been carving a place for themselves in Ghost City for years, blissfully free of misfortune that plagued them in life - up till the day a blood rain brings changes and with them, the nightmare they believed to have left behind.$f$, 3704, 1, 1, true, 5, false, $f$2019-10-21T02:43:32.901+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-21T02:43:32.933+00:00$f$, $f$2019-04-02T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18333668, $f$like lullabies you are forever in my mind. (i wanted only you)$f$, ARRAY[$f$bloodfruit$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Hua Cheng shifts his body, trying to lessen the weight of his body atop the crown prince’s but his knee shifts and it’s pressing between his strong thighs and — and— oh —
  Xie Lian moans softly at the pressure of Hua Cheng’s corded thigh against his cunt, fingers nearly shredding the sleeve fabric in his grip. Horror sinks into Xie Lian’s chest, stomach sinking like a corpse as he realises the sound that had slipped from his lips. His free hand darts from where it rests captive between their bodies to hide away his mouth, betrayer of his most intimate sounds. Above him, Hua Cheng goes stock still, breath caught against sharpened teeth.   
  They breathe.
  The coffin creaks.
  “Gege…” His voice trembles, anxiety palpable in the pitch and shift of his voice. Tension writes confessions in his limbs, arm shaking as if it wished its owner would shift to its elbows instead of his palm Still, he holds himself above Xie Lian, regal as only the Ghost King could be. “Gege, are you… are you wet?”$f$, 5213, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-10-13T17:19:59.095+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-13T17:19:59.122+00:00$f$, $f$2019-04-03T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18342059, $f$Popsicle (or the time XL ate a popsicle and HC got a boner)$f$, ARRAY[$f$Tsubakyun$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Xie Lian and Hua Cheng were on their weekly (not) date and decided to eat some ice cream.
Hua Cheng never expected the day to end like that.$f$, 3628, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-10-09T11:48:28.040+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-09T11:48:28.091+00:00$f$, $f$2019-04-03T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18345950, $f$Give Me A Sign.$f$, ARRAY[$f$Hell_Serpent$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$From demons to corpses and the creatures in between.There were once whispers of the spirits who'd never be seen.They're the ones that have been and always will be by your side.Born in the heart, they shine in your eyes and shows the true you inside.(And Wei Ying doesn't know how to feel about that.)$f$, 2040, 3, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-11-03T16:46:21.635+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-03T16:46:21.695+00:00$f$, $f$2019-04-29T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
