($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18361157, $f$Sky True$f$, ARRAY[$f$insertmdzspseud (hati_skoll)$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Wei Wuxian is unpresented when he first sets foot in Yunshen Palace and sets his eyes on Gusu's chivalrous, dashing, though weirdly stone-faced second prince.Lan Wangji has just come into his alpha instincts when he first takes to court and catches the scent of sunshine on a pretty, friendly, also incessantly noisy stranger.It's the start of a beautiful friendship (courtship). Probably.$f$, 21264, 4, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-10-25T10:34:16.092+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-25T10:34:16.106+00:00$f$, $f$2019-09-21T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
