($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18488491, $f$How Rare Would You Like Your Ship?$f$, ARRAY[$f$Befallings$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$What if Person A ends up with Person C instead of Person B? What if the original story was set in a different era? What if they end up in a universe with rules different from their own? What if the main characters are not the main characters? From various Ships to AUs, from crossovers to introspection, I will put our favourite MDZS family in every scene I can think of, some silly, some cute, some sad. Mostly sad. Switching updates to twice a week.Now with relationship tags in place.$f$, 68279, 31, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-12-29T14:12:13.716+00:00$f$, $f$2019-12-29T14:12:13.749+00:00$f$, $f$2019-12-29T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18490294, $f$i've got the spirit, but lose the feeling$f$, ARRAY[$f$armario$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Dishonored (Video Games)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$The Outsider is mortal now, and someone else is taking care of the Void.$f$, 1910, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-05-28T04:00:19.951+00:00$f$, $f$2019-05-28T04:00:20.022+00:00$f$, $f$2019-04-16T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18502273, $f$You Can't Be Lucky With All Things$f$, ARRAY[$f$Anonymous$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$While Xie Lian and Hua Cheng were in the inn on their way to Mount TongLu,  Hua Cheng was  suddenly struck with another wave of arousal, and it seems to have effected him more than it should have.. a lot more than it should have..$f$, 2416, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-10-09T11:53:04.241+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-09T11:53:04.287+00:00$f$, $f$2019-04-17T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18502978, $f$Two Weeks$f$, ARRAY[$f$heeroluva$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$The Hobbit (Jackson Movies)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Thranduil is well and truly fucked, stuffed full of numerous tentacles, moaning in pleasure as Nendarik begins the slow process of filling him with eggs when a familiar voice cuts through the pleasurable fog he’s fallen into.$f$, 2422, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-08-23T11:33:43.258+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-23T11:33:43.281+00:00$f$, $f$2019-04-22T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18504757, $f$Bountiful Harvest$f$, ARRAY[$f$marmolita$f$, $f$misswonderheart$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Original Work$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$"When the ritual is over," Tovi said, "will you let me go?"Aris laughed, a low, musical chuckle.  "Oh, Your Highness. After the ritual, you won't want to leave."$f$, 3220, 1, 1, true, 5, false, $f$2019-04-28T00:01:21.526+00:00$f$, $f$2019-04-28T00:01:21.562+00:00$f$, $f$2019-04-21T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18514141, $f$As Above, So Below$f$, ARRAY[$f$thedevilchicken$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Original Work$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Many years ago, the leaders of Kyr and Kault signed a treaty to keep the peace in the peninsulae; their successors, however, did not honour it. Istvan, the Giant of Kault, invades Kyr with all his forces and takes the king as his prize. Ettian, the newly deposed king, slowly begins to understand precisely why the treaty was broken in the first place.$f$, 10651, 1, 1, true, 3, false, $f$2019-04-28T00:01:31.031+00:00$f$, $f$2019-04-28T00:01:31.046+00:00$f$, $f$2019-04-18T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18529321, $f$The return of the sect leader$f$, ARRAY[$f$Nom_NomHomo$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$魔道祖师 | Módào Zǔshī (Cartoon)$f$, $f$슈퍼맨이 돌아왔다 | The Return of Superman$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Just the awkward journey of two parents to nurture and properly raise their children to at least funcional adults.          Said parents being the famous Jiang Fengmian and Yu Ziyuan, power couple of the decade. Yanli wants to sing.Cheng wants to rap.Ying can't even walk yet.$f$, 4459, 2, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-11-03T20:42:55.752+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-03T20:42:55.771+00:00$f$, $f$2019-06-21T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18529339, $f$Crack TGCF AUs$f$, ARRAY[$f$Cherished_Lantern_Glowing$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Collection of the random AU drabbles I made for TGCF, with MUCH inspiration from the server.$f$, 340, 4, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-10-13T11:55:52.807+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-13T11:55:52.836+00:00$f$, $f$2019-04-20T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18534862, $f$Circle in the Sand$f$, ARRAY[$f$Befallings$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$西遊記 | Xī Yóu Jì | Journey to the West - All Media Types$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$There was once a Buddhist master with four disciples. They went on a journey filled with monsters and magic. They fought enemies and they fought each other. Finally, they reached their goal. You have probably heard of that story before. But this is not that story. This story is a journey doomed to never succeed.$f$, 17129, 6, 6, true, -1, false, $f$2019-11-03T20:49:52.794+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-03T20:49:52.812+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-04T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18536188, $f$this garden once was perfect$f$, ARRAY[$f$Anonymous$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Original Work$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$When he’d gotten the tell-tale ringing in his ears that signified one of his demon-traps had been sprung just as he was about to turn in for the night, Father Lowell had really hoped it was just some easily-banished minor imp or somesuch.$f$, 2223, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2019-04-23T01:53:33.861+00:00$f$, $f$2019-04-23T01:53:33.934+00:00$f$, $f$2019-04-20T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18548011, $f$under soft wings of steel$f$, ARRAY[$f$Pippitypopadoo$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$He doesn’t particularly wish to have to suffer through the whispers and disgusted glances that are masked as pity, but he wanted to be here for Yanli, who has been the kindest and most genuine person he has ever met in his life. All he has to do is attend the party, join in for the family photos later and then quietly bid them goodbye-“Xiao Yu, what are you eating?” A voice pops the quiet bubble of peace that surrounds him and he looks up, fingers clutching his chopsticks tighter.---No one has Mo Xuanyu's back the way Jiang Yanli does$f$, 3960, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-11-03T14:17:30.810+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-03T14:17:30.841+00:00$f$, $f$2019-04-21T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18548353, $f$The Place of Caught Breath$f$, ARRAY[$f$OzQueen$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Miss Fisher's Murder Mysteries$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Her fingers pushed through his neatly-combed hair, and she eyed the lipstick smudged on his mouth before she met his gaze. "It's my birthday," she whispered."It is well past the final hour of your day," Jack murmured, though he didn't pull away. "Don't be greedy."$f$, 1945, 1, 1, true, 3, true, $f$2019-04-28T00:01:34.355+00:00$f$, $f$2019-04-28T00:01:34.356+00:00$f$, $f$2019-04-21T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18554137, $f$Desiderium$f$, ARRAY[$f$seredemia$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$After the war is over, the imperial realm can finally breathe a sigh of relief. While there is much celebration to be had, the price of war claims the life of their emperor, thus throwing the realm into uncertainty. Prince Lan Wangji must now watch as his older brother inherits the throne, bearing the weight of the legacy their father left behind.That, however, is the least of his worries. As the lands gather in celebration, Prince Lan Wangji is reunited with a man he has not seen in thirteen years. Wei Wuxian's smile is as captivating as ever; and with each day that passes, the prince struggles more and more to stay away from him.$f$, 20799, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-10-30T07:48:01.321+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-30T07:48:01.334+00:00$f$, $f$2019-04-22T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
