($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18568903, $f$Behind the Glass Tank$f$, ARRAY[$f$LeMayora$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Lan Xichen was sent to join a circus troupe where he met a siren named Jiang Cheng. Adjusting to the new environment and new people he befriended Jiang Cheng and things started to get more complicated then.//Basically a XiCheng SirenAU//$f$, 1921, 1, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-11-03T20:42:52.910+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-03T20:42:52.924+00:00$f$, $f$2019-04-23T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18569776, $f$Swordplay$f$, ARRAY[$f$BeneaththeBrim$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Somehow, somewhere between the hazy recesses of passing aeons and the swirling nebulae of thought, these scenes merged with other, hotter ones--fuel and fire pressed tight in some unholy crucible--and Hua Cheng found himself, his dream self, begging Dianxia to run him through, chop him up, tear him apart. It was these fantasies that seemed to seep through the cracks, charging the armory with the special resonance that thrives between death and love.
 Content Warning: I'm not joking about the 'Graphic Depictions of Violence' warning. There's a lot of blood.$f$, 2741, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-10-13T17:24:05.672+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-13T17:24:05.702+00:00$f$, $f$2019-04-23T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
