($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18622750, $f$Gravitational Fairytale$f$, ARRAY[$f$Jafndaegur$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$魔道祖师 | Módào Zǔshī (Cartoon)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Mo Xuanyu, since he was young, tries as hard as he can to forget he is the reincarnation of a man named Wei Wuxian. He just wants to move as quietly as he can through high school so he can graduate and go on to university. Being labeled a delinquent and a demon since his youth makes that particular goal difficult. White robes embraced by cerulean clouds.The sounds of a dizi reverberating off the notes of a guqin.Powers to control resentful energy.These were the only things Mo Xuanyu remembered in the loudness of modern-day.$f$, 6608, 6, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-11-03T13:32:19.074+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-03T13:32:19.094+00:00$f$, $f$2019-06-12T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
