Unbearable. Cursed it be.$f$, 1168, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-05-28T03:26:39.737+00:00$f$, $f$2019-05-28T03:26:39.794+00:00$f$, $f$2019-04-29T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18651547, $f$When It's Right It'll Find You$f$, ARRAY[$f$dynamicsymmetry$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Dishonored (Video Games)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$It's been a few thousand years since the Outsider was human, and now that he is again, he doesn't feel like he's very good at it. So when he doesn't know what else to do, he goes to find the one real friend he has left. And then things happen.$f$, 30422, 10, 13, false, 1, false, $f$2019-07-13T02:26:06.780+00:00$f$, $f$2019-07-13T02:26:07.036+00:00$f$, $f$2019-06-17T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18653278, $f$cartographist$f$, ARRAY[$f$Einhorn$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$The summer sun’s early morning rays bathe the bed Xie Lian shares with his husband and warm his freckled skin. Sleepy, content, and comfortable, he is loathe to leave the embrace of the blanket that he lays under, even though he knows that there is much to do in the dreary shrine he calls home.$f$, 3024, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-10-09T11:43:49.851+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-09T11:43:49.873+00:00$f$, $f$2019-04-30T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
