($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18672715, $f$Burning Touches and Repressed Desires$f$, ARRAY[$f$salty_gay_prince$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$What COULD have happened when the demon heat struck Hua Cheng. Xie Lian has his hands full and things are taking a turn he is not sure how to handle. But oh...it feels so nice. And he wonders how bad it would be to just give in to the offered pleasure?Xie Lian is going to find out!Just self indulgent smut oops....Trans AUXie Lian is a trans man.If you are against trans fics please dont read.$f$, 5640, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-10-12T11:25:25.709+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-12T11:25:25.727+00:00$f$, $f$2019-05-01T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18673576, $f$Mission: Escape Single Dog Hell$f$, ARRAY[$f$midohana$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$魔道祖师 | Módào Zǔshī (Cartoon)$f$, $f$人渣反派自救系统 - 墨香铜臭 | The Scum Villain's Self-Saving System - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$【We welcome your entrance into the system. We hope to provide you with the best experience. It is our sincere hope that during the course of your experience, you can achieve what you desired. To obtain a proper love life and transcend the level of your originally virgin death.】Hey! Who the hell is a virgin!?【You are. And so is your character ‘Jiang Cheng’.】~~~~Someone needs to settle down. Jiang Cheng too needs to find a partner. They match the System's algorithm, so they embark on a journey to get laid.$f$, 59282, 25, 25, true, -1, false, $f$2019-11-30T23:42:47.444+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-30T23:42:47.471+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-06T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18673786, $f$A Lotus Grows in the Field of Corpses$f$, ARRAY[$f$IceQueen975$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$魔道祖师 | Módào Zǔshī (Cartoon)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$A life cut short in the name of vengeance. The grief of the one left behind.Ruan Huifu follows in the footsteps of the infamous Wei Wuxian to find the reason for the death of the one she loved most; Mo XuanYu. Sometimes the truth is best left buried. Sometimes it’s only after being dyed with sorrow can something beautiful bloom in the decay.$f$, 13361, 4, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-11-30T18:51:46.327+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-30T18:51:46.349+00:00$f$, $f$2019-05-07T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18692737, $f$OUT OF THE DARKNESS INTO THE LIGHT$f$, ARRAY[$f$AngelaVargas$f$, $f$AngeloVargas$f$, $f$FongLian$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Since the day my Parents died, I lived alone until I was picked up by unknown strangers and took me to a place where so dark and cold. There I met a Boy older than me by a Year two he had a kind and gentle smile, in the midst of cold darkness his light shines through, his strength and warmth had been the Comfort he knew in his Dark Times and his voice and laughter had been my Guide to see through the darkness...“My Name is Lan ZhiYun, Courtesy Name Lan Tiāné, May I know your name?” The Blue Eyed boy asked his voice is Gentle yet it held Strength and Warmth.“My Name is Wei Ying, Courtesy Name Wei WuXian...” I answered.“What a Wonderful Name!” ZhiYun said with a smile.But again... Fate is Cruel as always as I was taken away from him... and when I met him again, it was the last time I’ll see his Kind Face and Gentle Smile...$f$, 6697, 2, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-11-03T20:41:43.065+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-03T20:41:43.091+00:00$f$, $f$2019-05-04T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
