($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18716491, $f$Human in feathered coat$f$, ARRAY[$f$Verse$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Because there is only so much Sizhui can see.Or: the Lion in human hide extras.$f$, 5200, 6, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-11-03T13:28:07.658+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-03T13:28:07.676+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-14T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18717502, $f$Hell Is Nearer Than You Think.$f$, ARRAY[$f$Hell_Serpent$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$人渣反派自救系统 - 墨香铜臭 | The Scum Villain's Self-Saving System - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$This was not what Sizhui - or even Jingyi - had in mind for a vacation."Welcome to Hell! Would you like a beer latte?""What?" Jin Ling huffed at the staring, sipping some of the beverage, "It's good."$f$, 655, 2, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-11-30T18:51:55.559+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-30T18:51:55.587+00:00$f$, $f$2019-05-07T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18717526, $f$The Mo Xuanyu Show$f$, ARRAY[$f$tothemovies (jarofactonbell)$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$“But sometimes, my instructor told me, you don’t have time to do all of that choreo, so under every and all circumstances, you should prioritise getting out of the hold in whatever way you can.”Xuanyu grins, his Shit Eating, Cultivated and Nurtured Queer Turning Smile™, at the detriment of all straight boys from Gusu Private. The audience falls completely silent and there is not even a single breath circulating in that spacious auditorium.“I was like all good, fam, I’m gonna make it happen. So my partner, poor sod, had me in a chokehold, and we’re all getting ready to get out first, instructor said  GO,”  he giggles, predatorily, and delivers the ultimatum.“I looked my partner right in the eye and went,” his voice climbs up to a breathy whisper, sultry and ragged,  “Oh, daddy.”    "And he let go! He let go! That's all that matters!"$f$, 3913, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-11-03T14:12:41.615+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-03T14:12:41.642+00:00$f$, $f$2019-05-05T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18724705, $f$Local God throws himself into Hell and tells the World to fuck off, Find Out His Story HERE!$f$, ARRAY[$f$IceBreeze$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Xie Lian is a man as tired of the world as the world is of him, to whom every step is the drag of feet across the ground as he wonders when he will next trip, when he will next fall (when he will be pushed, pushed, pushed, because he did all he could to help and the world did all it could to tear him apart). Xie Lian is a man to whom life is a curse, the chore of someone who even death has turned its back on, and he wishes it would be over.
  I want to rest, he thinks. I want to be at peace, and that is a thing he will never find in this sham of a life. The damned will wander for eternity whilst the world watches and laughs, trapped in this hell where even fire refuses to burn. Parents buried, a kingdom lost, the only companion at his side the piece of silk that failed to free him- this is a man who is adrift, who doesn’t know what to do now that everything has fallen and fallen apart.
  This is a man adrift, and so he sets himself adrift more literally.
An AU where Xie Lian is a Ghost King, Hua Cheng is a God, and He Xuan is- well. He Xuan.$f$, 16267, 4, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-10-13T17:18:57.060+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-13T17:18:57.095+00:00$f$, $f$2019-07-18T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18736159, $f$The Cold Springs Where We Lie$f$, ARRAY[$f$SugarAppleBlue$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Wei Wuxian, adopted into the royal family of Elemental Elves of the Yunmeng Kingdom, tried to avoid marriage by becoming a delegate. A position that allows him to travel between the three realms to negotiate and discuss current matters. But after slipping out to view the Dragon Festival of Gusu Lan by dressing as a woman to avoid a meeting with Lan Qiren, he runs into Lan Wangji who then declares Wei Wuxian will be whom he marries. But the Second Prince of Lan knows Wei Wuxian isn't actually a woman.. right?Hopefully Jiang Cheng will find this funnier than he does.Meanwhile, Jiang Yanli may have found a way to stop humans from poaching dragons.$f$, 3271, 2, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-10-30T08:00:19.573+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-30T08:00:19.595+00:00$f$, $f$2019-07-07T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18743335, $f$Anew$f$, ARRAY[$f$OngNiel9596$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$人渣反派自救系统 - 墨香铜臭 | The Scum Villain's Self-Saving System - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$As Shen Qingqiu, Shen Yuan always wondered what would happen if he dies again. Would he transmigrate back to his original body? To a new body in another story? 
A few years after he truthfully told his husband about his circumstances, he found himself dead, and transmigrated back into his original world. Only, he migrated back to his 12 year old self, years before his death.
With his memories intact, he intends to keep to his promise with Luo Binghe, whom he was sure would have killed himself when his beloved died, and hopefully find him before he dies again.$f$, 22643, 4, 4, true, -1, false, $f$2019-11-04T12:45:16.183+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-04T12:45:16.205+00:00$f$, $f$2019-05-22T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18754450, $f$twisting the knife$f$, ARRAY[$f$SilentRabidWriter$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$He finally turns his head to greet Hua Cheng, but the words die on his lips. The infamous crimson rain sought flower is still standing at the door, just as frozen as the ghost at his feet. A faint blush stains his pale cheeks and his gaze is fixed to the knife in Xie Lian’s hand.
  Oh, he thinks and something pleasantly warm stirs in his stomach. He drags the knife down Qi Rong's throat and Hua Cheng swallows.
   Oh.
There's something about Xie Lian holding a knife that just gets to Hua Cheng.  Xie Lian intends to make the most of it.$f$, 2334, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2019-10-20T01:48:31.345+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-20T01:48:31.383+00:00$f$, $f$2019-05-08T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18772993, $f$When You Wish Upon A Star$f$, ARRAY[$f$Adwen$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$After dabbling with the dark arts and causing one too many mass corpse uprisings across the kingdoms, Wei Wuxian was placed under a terrible curse and never seen again.Thirteen years later, fairy godmother Mo Xuanyu is put on probation after one too many mishaps and is assigned charge of prince Lan Wangji. His goal is to help him find whatever it is he has been diligently searching for all these years, and only that.Breaking a criminal from his jail, uncovering a kingdom-wide conspiracy, and firing himself from his job were all accidents! Truly!(or, the self-indulgent Disney-inspired au that no one asked for but I wrote anyway)$f$, 2289, 1, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-11-03T14:10:12.378+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-03T14:10:12.394+00:00$f$, $f$2019-05-10T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18777682, $f$make this chaos count$f$, ARRAY[$f$lichti$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$A whimper spills out Xie Lian’s lips as Hua Cheng bites the back of his neck roughly, littering pale skin with marks. “Bad boys deserve punishment.”$f$, 2259, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-10-09T11:44:34.228+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-09T11:44:34.243+00:00$f$, $f$2019-05-10T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18777766, $f$BLESSINGS OF THE LOTUS$f$, ARRAY[$f$AngelaVargas$f$, $f$AngeloVargas$f$, $f$FongLian$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Jiang FengMian after a Bad Separation between him and Madam Yu is in a lot of pain, Ill rumours Grew and Worsen causing Yunmeng to Fall From Grace, Meishan Yu taking its place as the Fourth Prominent Sect through Madam Yu’s Lead. Yunmeng Jiang had suffered Humiliation after Humiliation from Meishan Yu, Jiang FengMian is at his wits end and can no longer take it. But he can’t just leave his Daughter Behind so he can’t die yet.And Sometimes it takes only one act of kindness and caring to change a person’s life.On a Snowy Day of Winter while walking on the Barren streets of a once lively town, Jiang FengMian meets a stranger who is seeking shelter on a small stall, being raised as a Kind man. He offered Shelter to this Wanderer and in doing so, his Life will soon Change.$f$, 15689, 4, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-10-30T07:51:01.364+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-30T07:51:01.390+00:00$f$, $f$2019-06-16T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18787090, $f$Transcendence$f$, ARRAY[$f$chip1$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Cultivators, demons and gods.As he jumped through time, Wei Ying is about to discover that legends are not always legends after all. Inspired by InuYasha!$f$, 84095, 17, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-10-25T10:35:41.585+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-25T10:35:41.617+00:00$f$, $f$2019-09-24T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18795724, $f$A Balm for Aching Hearts$f$, ARRAY[$f$Zaatar$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$The Silmarillion and other histories of Middle-Earth - J. R. R. Tolkien$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$In the Fen of Serech, Barahir teaches Finrod how to mourn.$f$, 3182, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2019-07-31T03:53:00.369+00:00$f$, $f$2019-07-31T03:53:00.424+00:00$f$, $f$2019-05-12T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18802795, $f$This Tender Heart of Fire$f$, ARRAY[$f$Pteropoda (SilentP)$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$The second time Xie Lian ever suffered the effects of Land of the Tender, it was just as unwanted as the first.$f$, 3474, 1, 1, true, 3, false, $f$2019-10-13T17:26:00.072+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-13T17:26:00.104+00:00$f$, $f$2019-05-12T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18810604, $f$Wen Ning, you're a vampire$f$, ARRAY[$f$tothemovies (jarofactonbell)$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$“Sorry I pretended to spread the rumour that you were a vampire!” Wuxian turns to him after he and Jiang Cheng engaged in a weird battle ritual of jellyfish arm dancing and dabbing, and Jiang Cheng rushes off to whip more vampires to obedience, now with actual blood energy powering his whiplashes.Those must hurt. Imagine the shame on top of that too. Imagine being asked - Hey, what happened today at work? And answering with - Oh, nothing much. Just got sent to the surface to take out some brats at a party but then I got whipped into a coma by a guy in a bun - nothing much went down before that.$f$, 13595, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-11-30T18:51:29.027+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-30T18:51:29.056+00:00$f$, $f$2019-05-13T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18835072, $f$a god of equilibrium$f$, ARRAY[$f$rievu$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Dishonored (Video Games)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$The Outsider forgets how to breathe sometimes.It’s not important; it’s not necessary. But sometimes, in the middle of the vast Void, the Outsider clutches at his throat — where is his esophagus, his trachea, his pharynx — and finds nothing. No air, no flesh, no material there to breathe. He chokes on the realization, but he doesn’t know if he can even choke if he can’t breathe. The lifespan of a god is doomed to be eternal, and eternity is such a wide space for forgetting such things. Such unnecessary things. But they were once necessary to the Outsider in the days when he was mortal and was ignorant to such concepts like divinity and immortality. The ever-present whalesong in the distance now sounds mocking, and the Outsider clenches his fists into semblances of shadow.The Outsider forgets sometimes.
// a character study on the outsider and how he forgets (and remembers) to be physically mortal$f$, 5315, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-05-31T12:14:40.726+00:00$f$, $f$2019-05-31T12:14:40.817+00:00$f$, $f$2019-05-15T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18835204, $f$don't fix what's already broken(simply go and build something better)$f$, ARRAY[$f$Lucystar$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$魔道祖师 | Módào Zǔshī (Cartoon)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Wei Wuxian remembered life being easier. At some point in his life where he could look at golden eyes without pain and feeling his heart shatter to a million pieces.  When those eyes made him feel like flying and falling at the same time, where golden eyes ment safe, trust, and love. Now he couldn't even look at them from guilt, hurt, and helplessness. Everything felt and was so wrong, and he couldn't help but wish he could scream 'why' to the Heavens. Why if everything had been so perfect was it now just so broken? And how? How does one fix everything so that it's as it should be?$f$, 12419, 5, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-10-30T11:53:34.478+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-30T11:53:34.513+00:00$f$, $f$2019-06-01T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18842227, $f$When we run out of air$f$, ARRAY[$f$lanjingyeets$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 | Módào Zǔshī (Cartoon)$f$, $f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$There’s the faintest smell of incense in the air, two sticks sinking in the burner and a thin trail of smoke rising to the ceiling. The smell reminds him of far-away parties and drinks, of celebrations and molten heat beneath his skin. Zixuan sweeps his sleeve above the incense sticks, and the gentle breeze makes the smoke quiver mid-air. It trembles together with his breathing, and he slowly lowers his arm.

  His room is draped in red, with lanterns hanging just outside and the soft whispers of servants traveling through the thin walls. Whispers about him, whisperings about her. Whispers about them.


  
    And so Young Master Jin marries today,
  
   someone murmurs, and the sound of a bucket being filled with water covers the words that follow. But Jin Zixuan still grasps the words that come after, I’ve seen Madam Jiang, and oh, she was so beautiful, Young Master Jin will be surely speechless when he sees her.

  But for that, there’s no need for him to see Yanli; Zixuan hasn’t even left the groom’s house, and he’s already breathless.$f$, 4747, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-11-19T03:44:10.857+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-19T03:44:10.869+00:00$f$, $f$2019-05-16T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18850702, $f$In the Night, Dream Delight$f$, ARRAY[$f$zacechild$f$, $f$atomicmuffin$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Xie Lian is pure of mind and pure of body. Xie Lian is above bodily desires. Xie Lian meditates and chants sutras to keep impure desires at bay......Yeah, but his subconscious is apparently horny on main for Hua Cheng.And you can't chant sutras in your dreams.$f$, 9269, 1, 1, true, 3, false, $f$2019-10-13T17:17:53.701+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-13T17:17:53.728+00:00$f$, $f$2019-05-16T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18869938, $f$There's no medicine for regret$f$, ARRAY[$f$samvelg$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$It is a truth universally acknowledged, that a single Devastation in possession of good fortune must be in want of a vulgar trash goblin to beat the everloving shit out of.In which Qi Rong works out why Hua Cheng hates looking at his face so much, and our favourite Devastation has a very bad time.$f$, 2980, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-10-12T11:28:41.214+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-12T11:28:41.246+00:00$f$, $f$2019-05-18T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18873307, $f$Souvenirs du future (Memories of the future)$f$, ARRAY[$f$KagamiNoYume$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Xue Yang goes back into the past before he killed He Su. He decides everything was Jin GuangYao's fault and starts saving people in order to destroy the latter's reputation (he also wants to kill him afterward).A remix of the Yi Cheng Arc with a Xue Yang who doesn't mess things up, everyone knowing A-Qing isn't blind and Jin RuSong, Mo XuanYu and He Su's sister living with XY, AQ and XXC. Wen Ning, Wen Qing, Song Lan and Nie MingJue coming later. Xue Yang working with Nie HuaiSang.$f$, 28952, 7, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-11-19T03:32:51.151+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-19T03:32:51.202+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-09T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18874498, $f$Cryptids are not Permitted in the Cloud Recesses$f$, ARRAY[$f$crossdressingdeath$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$$f$, 75859, 21, NULL, false, 1, false, $f$2019-10-23T03:40:54.766+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-23T03:40:54.793+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-20T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18879298, $f$In the Spotlight$f$, ARRAY[$f$OngNiel9596$f$, $f$Yeong$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$人渣反派自救系统 - 墨香铜臭 | The Scum Villain's Self-Saving System - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Some people dream of saving the world, some dream of an easy life, while some dream of being in the spotlight.
And who was to say you could only have one dream? Why not dream of falling in love while you are at it?
That was exactly what they did.$f$, 6752, 2, 4, false, -1, false, $f$2019-11-04T12:45:11.823+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-04T12:45:11.853+00:00$f$, $f$2019-05-27T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18882565, $f$Unrestrained$f$, ARRAY[$f$Sath$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$杀破狼 | Sha Po Lang - priest$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Chang Geng and Gu Yun's first time.$f$, 2090, 1, 1, true, 5, false, $f$2019-08-17T02:06:05.749+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-17T02:06:05.781+00:00$f$, $f$2019-05-19T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18884950, $f$dreadful need in the devotee$f$, ARRAY[$f$pancakesprince$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$A rush of demonic energy passes through Mt Tonglu, causing all the remaining unholy beings to descend into a feral state.(Spoilers for chapter 174-175)$f$, 1017, 1, 1, true, 3, false, $f$2019-10-18T11:41:38.120+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-18T11:41:38.151+00:00$f$, $f$2019-05-19T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18884962, $f$Office Rendezvous$f$, ARRAY[$f$captainhoothoot$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$魔道祖师 | Módào Zǔshī (Cartoon)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$In the midst of a quiet night, a figure of a well-built man groaned lowly, a sound that sounded more like a guttural growl, one that was almost inaudible, had the silence of the room not been stifling.  Accompanied by wet squelches and sharp slaps of moist skin coming into contact, the room, dark and quiet, was simply lit by the lighting of the buildings and towers overlooking this bustling city and the room on the top floor they were in. Shut behind the closed doors, sheathed behind the soundproof walls, hidden behind all scrutiny, the sheer debauchery between two grown men of different juxtaposing backgrounds came to light in this room. Pressed against the glass windows that extended from the marble flooring to the top of the ceiling, a young man panted heavily, his hot breath fogging the glass windows. Calloused hands ran down the smooth expanse of his body, pausing at his thighs, spreading them apart into a wider stance. Shame gnawed at his insides at being put into such a humiliating position. To be taken. Fucked. Bred. His lips quivered against the cool glass at the thought of it. Bred.$f$, 26198, 13, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-11-30T23:42:06.902+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-30T23:42:06.941+00:00$f$, $f$2019-09-26T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18900478, $f$Flowers from a Lake | Mo Dao Zu Shi Stage Musical Songs$f$, ARRAY[$f$TheColorBlue$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Being assorted stage musical piano and vocal pieces.-"The Song of Dafan Mountain" : Lan WangJi's and Jiang Cheng's suppressed emotions involving capturing Wei Wuxian are dramatized through song.-"The Song of Mo Xuanyu" : concerning the backstory of Mo Xuanyu during the body offering ritual.-"The Song of the Corpse General" : intended to invoke a folk song about the mythical Corpse General who served the Yiling Patriarch and who also has a stutter.$f$, 699, 3, 3, true, -1, false, $f$2019-11-03T20:46:20.612+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-03T20:46:20.649+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-06T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18901942, $f$Clothes Redder Than Maple$f$, ARRAY[$f$Naamah_Beherit$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$For centuries, Xie Lian has wandered alone with only RuoYe for company. For centuries, he's been nothing but a reflection of an age long forgotten, powerless and bound to the mortal realm.It takes an encounter with a swarm of hungry ghosts to change his fate. Russian translation (Ficbook)Spanish translation: AO3 | Wattpad$f$, 1157, 1, 1, true, 3, false, $f$2019-12-25T15:50:48.672+00:00$f$, $f$2019-12-25T15:50:48.701+00:00$f$, $f$2019-05-20T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18903883, $f$514$f$, ARRAY[$f$nanthebread$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Mo Xuanyu was not afraid to die.-Introspective ficlet looking into the last moments of his life,  a man with more kindness and intelligence than people gave him credit for.$f$, 978, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2019-11-03T20:21:13.628+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-03T20:21:13.654+00:00$f$, $f$2019-05-21T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18910021, $f$Love like a roar$f$, ARRAY[$f$samvelg$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$His heart is an abyss, his love as much a sword as it is a flower, and he's known all his life that it's far too monstrous for anyone to ever bear the weight of it. So maybe it was fate that when he finally fell it was for a God who was made of flowers and swords too, for a gentle smile which could make even ten years in hell feel like paradise.In which Hua Cheng enters Mount Tonglu a man in love, and no matter what else about him changes he still leaves as one too.$f$, 2502, 1, 1, true, 3, false, $f$2019-10-12T20:41:17.842+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-12T20:41:17.874+00:00$f$, $f$2019-05-21T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18917572, $f$El juego del destino y la desgracia de la suerte$f$, ARRAY[$f$Maki_Ryugazaki$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$镇魂 | Guardian (TV)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Lu Sin es un joven cultivador que ha alcanzado la inmortalidad, un día mientras medita en su habitación en las montañas de la secta Wei Lu, se ve transportado a un callejón oscuro y sucio... Frente a él se encuentra un niño de nombre Wei Ying.$f$, 14927, 7, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-11-30T18:49:50.189+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-30T18:49:50.220+00:00$f$, $f$2019-06-14T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18924349, $f$trapped in a dream( that made me have my gay awakening)$f$, ARRAY[$f$Viktoriskinky$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$While exploring a village to collect scraps, Xie Lian took on a mission to defeat a demon that's been bothering the mortals in the village.While fighting the demon, the demon sucked him into a explicit dream!$f$, 4853, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2019-10-13T02:53:38.250+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-13T02:53:38.303+00:00$f$, $f$2019-05-22T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18949744, $f$Invincible$f$, ARRAY[$f$Momiji_Lian$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Mo XuanYu convinces Nie HuaiSang that together, they are invincible. Holding on to this belief, they delve into countless everyday adventures, not afraid of anything. But should they maybe be afraid after all?$f$, 3671, 2, NULL, false, 1, false, $f$2019-11-28T01:14:33.682+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-28T01:14:33.711+00:00$f$, $f$2019-05-28T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18951052, $f$Time for Hello and Time for Goodbye$f$, ARRAY[$f$SomethingReallyWeird$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$$f$, 10287, 7, 7, true, -1, false, $f$2019-11-03T13:19:39.402+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-03T13:19:39.428+00:00$f$, $f$2019-05-24T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 18956176, $f$Позабытая мелодия$f$, ARRAY[$f$melamoryblack$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Dishonored (Video Games)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Спустя пять лет, прошедших с момента коронации Эмили, для Корво Чужой из полезного союзника превратился в близкого друга, и теперь нуждается в его помощи. Находясь в хрупком смертном теле, Чужой должен выяснить, что стало источником ужасных возмущений в Бездне. И как только причина станет ясна, он должен вернуть то, что по праву принадлежит ему.$f$, 2903, 1, 15, false, -1, false, $f$2019-05-27T01:09:25.137+00:00$f$, $f$2019-05-27T01:09:25.224+00:00$f$, $f$2019-05-25T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
