($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 19007095, $f$A Soft MXY thing$f$, ARRAY[$f$JustASadBoy$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Modern au where JYL helps MXY with his makeup for a date$f$, 1126, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-11-03T16:53:14.259+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-03T16:53:14.286+00:00$f$, $f$2019-05-28T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 19007590, $f$Strangers$f$, ARRAY[$f$WangXianPatriarch$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Lan XiChen is a man of mystery, so who could’ve known he used to have a fling with Jin Guangyao’s half-brother Mo XuanYu? Right, no one, not even his brother. So of course Lan WangJi has no idea why Lan XiChen thinks he can be so overly friendly to Mo XuanYu - who is in fact, by now, his very own precious Wei WuXian. (Prompt by anon on Tumblr)$f$, 2141, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-11-03T13:28:47.965+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-03T13:28:47.993+00:00$f$, $f$2019-05-29T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 19027207, $f$With Love$f$, ARRAY[$f$Wuxian_Biscuit (The_Tevinter_Biscuit)$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Everyone had heard of Wei Ying. Lan Zhan was no exception. He just wished he could go back to simpler times, when the two of them were just teenagers in China, with dreams and a promising future ahead of them.$f$, 87326, 15, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-11-20T04:49:55.823+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-20T04:49:55.857+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-02T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 19053982, $f$MDZS crazy modern AU$f$, ARRAY[$f$KagamiNoYume$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Many modern AU:Chap 1: Grandmaster of Demonic CrepesChap 2: if the Evil friends were fudanshiChap 3: doctor WQ, doctor assistant WN and medicine student LSZ talking about YLDR, WRH, XY, WY and JGYChap 4: cinnamon roll WN fighting backChap 5: LWJ and XXC, done with their lovers (WWX, XY) -are forced to- pretend dating by SL, AQ, JYL, LXC and JGYChap 6: same as above (part 2)Chap 7: same as above (part 3)Chap 8: same as above (part 4)Chap 9: same as above (part 5)Chap 10:$f$, 6746, 9, 10, false, -1, false, $f$2019-11-03T16:48:07.903+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-03T16:48:07.929+00:00$f$, $f$2019-09-08T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 19067122, $f$A Quiet Day$f$, ARRAY[$f$yonaka_tan$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Huaisang needs to do some paperwork. Xuanyu wants the picnic he was promised.They manage to compromise.For Sangyu Week 2019, Day 1: Domestic$f$, 1019, 1, 1, true, 5, false, $f$2019-11-21T12:23:12.562+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-21T12:23:12.665+00:00$f$, $f$2019-06-03T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 19071115, $f$Skin as White as Snow$f$, ARRAY[$f$Naamah_Beherit$f$, $f$misterymxgic$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$There’s a god of broken things.Things forgotten and lost, things ruined beyond repair. Things cast aside without care, things that used to bring joy and now remind only of regrets. Things the world turned a blind eye on, things best left untouched.There’s a god who isn’t a god.
***An encounter with a horde of hungry ghosts leaves Xie Lian stranded in Ghost City. A long time ago, he would've run. A long time ago, he would've been tempted to grab a sword and challenge every demon on his path.Now, all he can think of is that he may finally be able to rest for a while. Russian translation (Ficbook)Spanish translation: AO3 | Wattpad$f$, 3947, 1, 1, true, 5, false, $f$2019-11-17T15:44:34.601+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-17T15:44:34.787+00:00$f$, $f$2019-06-02T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
