($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 19075339, $f$The Star at the End of Time$f$, ARRAY[$f$spacehopper$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Dishonored (Video Games)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$He’d taken a leap of faith before. What was one more, for old time’s sake?$f$, 2762, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2019-06-29T15:24:15.273+00:00$f$, $f$2019-06-29T15:24:15.339+00:00$f$, $f$2019-06-03T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 19082569, $f$SangYu Week 2019 Ficlets collection$f$, ARRAY[$f$Lywet$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$魔道祖师 | Módào Zǔshī (Cartoon)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$$f$, 8226, 4, 7, false, 1, false, $f$2019-11-03T12:28:41.679+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-03T12:28:41.732+00:00$f$, $f$2019-06-06T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 19084684, $f$Four Horsemen of the Apocalypse$f$, ARRAY[$f$BlackHeartedSoul$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$魔道祖师 | Módào Zǔshī (Cartoon)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$In the world of cultivation exist cultivators and spirits that work hand in hand. Everyone is taught that resentful energy is bad, but what if it was needed to keep everything balanced? Good vs Evil? A set of malevolent spirits were created to keep the balance of resentful energy. However, in their spare time they helped found what would be know as the Great Sects: Gusu Lan, Yunmeng Jiang, Lanling Jin, and Qinghe Nie. Follow the tales of each of these Horsemen and the tragedy they each encounter only to be met with each of their happy endings. This is only the prologue for the series of tales for each the Horsemen.$f$, 2516, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-11-30T23:54:00.715+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-30T23:54:00.737+00:00$f$, $f$2019-06-04T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 19087141, $f$oscillatory$f$, ARRAY[$f$chinxe$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Wei Wuxian's pretty bad at being a pirate, and Lan Zhan isn't exactly a shining example for merpeople everywhere either.So apparently, they're perfect for each other.$f$, 14672, 2, 4, false, -1, false, $f$2019-10-25T10:43:33.025+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-25T10:43:33.060+00:00$f$, $f$2019-06-10T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 19091800, $f$Echoes$f$, ARRAY[$f$Anna-domini (Memoryboard)$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$“This,” he said, pointing a finger at Lan Wangji’s chest. “Is Wei Ying.”[Or: Cliche Soulmate AU Retelling]$f$, 37843, 10, 10, true, -1, false, $f$2019-10-25T10:37:26.795+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-25T10:37:26.819+00:00$f$, $f$2019-07-23T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 19091803, $f$i want to live, just once, before i die$f$, ARRAY[$f$luchiden$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Ashes to ashes, gold to gold.$f$, 1040, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2019-11-30T23:53:26.018+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-30T23:53:26.065+00:00$f$, $f$2019-06-04T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 19110043, $f$hide, seek, find$f$, ARRAY[$f$yonaka_tan$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Xuanyu has a problem: he's been pining after Second Young Master Nie for years.Xuanyu has a solution: indirect confession.For Sangyu Week, Day 3: Fan$f$, 2552, 1, 1, true, 5, false, $f$2019-11-21T12:24:46.086+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-21T12:24:46.236+00:00$f$, $f$2019-06-06T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 19116790, $f$A mirror for your lies$f$, ARRAY[$f$Starishadow$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$No matter how much he stared, the only thing he could see reflected in there was still anything he could never be.He closed his eyes and, for a moment, let himself be lulled away by the illusion of hands sliding over his shoulders, arms wrapping him in a hug, warmth being a part of his life once more.But as soon as he opened his eyes again, the cruel mirror seemed to laugh at him as it showed him his lonely reflection.$f$, 2738, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2019-11-01T09:15:31.535+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-01T09:15:31.567+00:00$f$, $f$2019-06-06T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 19128544, $f$Errant Mind, Wanton Flesh$f$, ARRAY[$f$Dragoncurl$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Dishonored (Video Games)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Originally written as the beginning of the sequel to Final Release, but I've since lost the spark to keep going. I still like what I did write, so I'm posting it anyway as some nice Smut.
In which the Outsider is sneaky, then horny. Corvo goes along with it because he can't let this dumb smug teenager out if his sight for five fucking minutes, seriously.$f$, 6304, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2019-06-29T02:58:34.390+00:00$f$, $f$2019-06-29T02:58:34.501+00:00$f$, $f$2019-06-07T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 19146034, $f$The Complications of Reincarnation$f$, ARRAY[$f$RiriLilly$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$The year is 2019. The four great cultivation sects thrive in secret, working undercover for the Chinese government with the task of taking care of supernatural crimes.Gusu cultivator Lan Zhan is given the mission to observe a university student named Wei Ying, reincarnation of the infamous Yilling Patriarch. Enamored by Wei Ying's constant teasing and playful smiles, Lan Zhan falls in love and starts to realize that his feelings have been around for much longer than he thought. Too bad Wei Ying has a crush on a dead ancestor named Lan Wangji.Modern AU where (almost) everyone is reincarnated into bad-ass cultivating spies, but still can’t get life together.$f$, 18299, 2, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-11-03T13:28:52.252+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-03T13:28:52.264+00:00$f$, $f$2019-06-26T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 19148038, $f$From the Sun, Moon, and Stars$f$, ARRAY[$f$RoseusJaeger$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Banished from Lotus Pier in the Feywild of Yunmeng, Wei WuXian is a young Drow elf looking to start a new life as a bard. He's always been good at playing dizi; it shouldn't be hard to find his place in the Material Plane, right? However, he encounters Lan WangJi. The man is a dragonborn paladin from the GusuLan sect, a sect born of a long line of heroes where one's oath means more than their own life. On a quest to prove himself to his clan, Lan WangJi intrigues Wei WuXian. What better way for Wei WuXian to find his way in the world than to aide the dragonborn on his holy quest for his clan and Bahamut, the good dragon god he worships?Of course, it's not that easy. Especially when Lolth, the Drow goddess of spiders, and Tiamat, the evil dragon goddess, are apparently working together to bring chaos to the Material Plane.$f$, 20217, 8, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-11-03T14:16:59.076+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-03T14:16:59.093+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-15T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 19155169, $f$The Festival of Toppled Phoenixes$f$, ARRAY[$f$BeneaththeBrim$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Hua Cheng has an idea for how to remove Xie Lian's shackles.It's gonna require some help from all of Ghost City, as well as an assortment of gods.Posted for Pride Month; here's an excerpt:
  This time, the butterfly transmitted a scene of a bustling street. On the margins, Xie Lian could make out clusters of ghosts and demons pressed against one another, mangled clumps of monstrous limbs and heads. In the center of the street, however, it became harder to discern individual ghosts; it was like the entire population of Ghost City had become a single, churning mass of raw sex. On the periphery, ghost fires of various colors set the seedy street ablaze, while amidst the central mass, rainbow-colored slime coated every slick body. There were some off-beat shrieks and bellows, but for the most part, the mass seemed to emit a tuneless, gibbering hum, rising and falling with the writhing waves of interlocking souls.$f$, 22575, 6, 6, true, -1, false, $f$2019-10-09T11:52:35.666+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-09T11:52:35.701+00:00$f$, $f$2019-06-30T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 19155982, $f$Receiving End$f$, ARRAY[$f$Holyangelheart$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Today is Hua Cheng's birthday and his one wish is to be topped by Xie Lian.$f$, 4805, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2019-10-20T01:19:27.947+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-20T01:19:27.968+00:00$f$, $f$2019-06-11T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 19158625, $f$I'm Here To Give You All Of My Love$f$, ARRAY[$f$JemTheKingOfSass$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Wiping her suddenly damp hands on the back of her pants, Hua Cheng approaches Xie Lian. She isn’t sure if the pounding in her chest is her traitorous heart or the bass-boosted music, but she’s light-headed as she clears her throat and forces a grin onto her face. Xie Lian smiles up at her, the flash of the dance floor lights playing across her pretty features, her wavy brown hair currently striped with pulsing blues and purples. Hua Cheng’s knees go weak at that expression directed at her. She has to grip the edge of the table before having a hope of hearing anything the other woman says.$f$, 3224, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-10-09T11:49:52.099+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-09T11:49:52.131+00:00$f$, $f$2019-06-10T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 19166197, $f$In This House$f$, ARRAY[$f$shinshin_kido$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$魔道祖师 | Módào Zǔshī (Cartoon)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$After getting a prestigious new job fresh out of university, Wei Wuxian moved out because the company's head office is in another city. It was all good, though, because he had managed to rent a good 2-bedroom apartment. Naturally, the landlord and landlady had also looked for another person to rent the property aside from him.Wei Wuxian didn't mind, but he didn't expect for his new roommate to be... Lan Wangji, whom he had not seen since high school graduation about 4 years ago. They now have one month to spend together before their new jobs start. New city, new job, new life, new... love?$f$, 41330, 12, 12, true, -1, false, $f$2019-11-30T18:49:16.845+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-30T18:49:16.864+00:00$f$, $f$2019-06-27T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 19168585, $f$Gotta die to come alive$f$, ARRAY[$f$Less_Ginger$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$There was nothing the Emperor regreted more than not showing his Empress how much he loved him when he still could.$f$, 55129, 14, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-10-23T13:21:50.993+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-23T13:21:51.014+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-15T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 19173769, $f$Worthless$f$, ARRAY[$f$Lianta_chan$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Hua Cheng's worst suffering.$f$, 1055, 1, 1, true, 3, false, $f$2019-10-13T12:08:13.248+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-13T12:08:13.275+00:00$f$, $f$2019-06-11T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 19179841, $f$All Our Tomorrows$f$, ARRAY[$f$dynamicsymmetry$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Dishonored (Video Games)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Sparring with Emily after the Outsider's first meal in Dunwall Tower, Corvo comes to some realizations.$f$, 3214, 2, NULL, false, 3, false, $f$2019-07-16T03:39:36.566+00:00$f$, $f$2019-07-16T03:39:36.629+00:00$f$, $f$2019-07-07T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 19189027, $f$untitled$f$, ARRAY[$f$Anonymous$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Xie Lian was once a popular submissive at a well-known club, but all that came to a halt after he parted from his dom on bad terms - disappearing from the scene altogether. After an invitation from the club owner, he comes back only to go investigate another club - where he meets the mysterious club owner - Hua Cheng.$f$, 2351, 1, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-10-09T11:51:13.381+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-09T11:51:13.418+00:00$f$, $f$2019-06-12T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 19206700, $f$No-Name$f$, ARRAY[$f$CygnusTrash$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$What if Xie Lian lost all disregards for his body$f$, 226, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2019-10-13T12:03:00.252+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-13T12:03:00.289+00:00$f$, $f$2019-06-13T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 19218091, $f$Ch. 190 From Hua Chengs POV$f$, ARRAY[$f$JustASadBoy$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$190 was full of knives so of course I wanted to write his pov lolOf course it has spoilers for this chapter if you haven't already read it.$f$, 1308, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-10-13T12:05:47.245+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-13T12:05:47.280+00:00$f$, $f$2019-06-14T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 19242550, $f$Of Skin and Scales$f$, ARRAY[$f$firesonic152$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$It was a dragon, Lan Zhan thought dizzily.He brought his hand to cup its face and distantly supposed that he should have been frightened at some point during this encounter. But the dragon leaned into his touch, intelligent eyes blinking down at him owlishly, and all he could think was how beautiful it was.(The state of Wei WuXian’s shape never mattered. Human or not, Lan WangJi falls in love.)$f$, 21271, 4, 4, true, -1, false, $f$2019-10-30T07:48:29.721+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-30T07:48:29.750+00:00$f$, $f$2019-06-21T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 19244647, $f$Three Questions$f$, ARRAY[$f$Sath$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$人渣反派自救系统 - 墨香铜臭 | The Scum Villain's Self-Saving System - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Yue Qingyuan keeps having to explain that no, he isn't dual cultivating with Shen Qingqiu.Or is he?$f$, 1022, 1, 1, true, 3, false, $f$2019-08-17T01:51:50.140+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-17T01:51:50.188+00:00$f$, $f$2019-06-16T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 19265359, $f$A Thousand Chances$f$, ARRAY[$f$chokeprildemon$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Some say the chance for a soul to be reincarnated is 1 out of 10 billion chances. And said reincarnated soul to forget their memories of their past life. But fate was not letting Xue Yang to have that luxury.
 
'your past pain will be attached to your body as long as your shadow still follows you'$f$, 5355, 2, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-11-03T20:42:36.312+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-03T20:42:36.342+00:00$f$, $f$2019-09-26T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 19288474, $f$i like me better when i'm with you$f$, ARRAY[$f$gintokitas$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Xie Lian can't help but think Hua Cheng makes a hell of a first impression. As they gradually begin speaking more, he comes to realize that many things about Hua Cheng are new, but others seem oddly familiar—like a memory tucked away just out of reach. Regardless, Xie Lian is drawn to him in a way that he can't explain to himself or to his best friend, Shi QingXuan. All he knows is that he enjoys Hua Cheng's company and wishes to spend as much time as possible with him. Just to become friends, though. Of course. 
Right?$f$, 46503, 8, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-10-09T11:45:05.803+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-09T11:45:05.822+00:00$f$, $f$2019-09-02T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 19318912, $f$The Blood of The Outsider$f$, ARRAY[$f$sp00kworm$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Dishonored (Video Games)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$The first ancient, The Outsider, bestows his gifts upon Corvo Attano in Coldridge prison. Corvo is given the powers to restore his daughter to her throne, but he is faced with two choices. To kill and be a murderer, fulfilling his desire for blood, or to take what he needs and let mercy be his cause.$f$, 2012, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-06-29T02:53:09.209+00:00$f$, $f$2019-06-29T02:53:09.314+00:00$f$, $f$2019-06-22T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 19320472, $f$What Makes Gods Tremble$f$, ARRAY[$f$Gotcocomilk$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$It began with passion, with shared breath and broken moans, with the stretch of skin and the rush of qi. It began with a desperate fuck and a clenched jaw, with lightning bound and trembling. It began with Jiang Cheng's shattered dignity, but it would end with his happiness.$f$, 35364, 8, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-10-25T10:32:50.882+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-25T10:32:50.907+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-05T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 19321759, $f$The Ghost Holds a Wedding$f$, ARRAY[$f$Naamah_Beherit$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$San Lang’s fingers ghost down the nape of his neck, reverent and hesitant, leaving a tingling trail that keeps on burning. In slow, long, purposeful strokes, he writes a story of adoration on the canvas of Xie Lian’s skin.

  His hands slow down when he brushes against the bandages wrapped around Xie Lian’s neck. Xie Lian stiffens involuntarily; then those hands come to rest on his shoulders, grounding and comforting. What would it feel like if San Lang were to venture lower, down his back and sides, what if he untied the worn-out silk and let his fingers trace the line of the shackle hidden beneath it, what if—

  Xie Lian takes a deep breath and thinks of the Ethics Sutra.
***Life goes on as Xie Lian settles in Ghost City. For the first time in centuries, he's content. For the first time in centuries, the future is hopeful.(Then why is he feeling so empty?) Russian translation (Ficbook)$f$, 39205, 9, 9, true, 5, false, $f$2019-12-25T15:48:49.977+00:00$f$, $f$2019-12-25T15:48:50.105+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-27T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
