($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 19401697, $f$here's how mo xuanyu can still win$f$, ARRAY[$f$MellonLord$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Mo XuanYu deserves better!! If I have to bs time travel Wei WuXian back from the future to make it happen, then so be it! "But if he could time travel why would he save Mo XuanYu and not his Shijie," "but if Mo XuanYu lives then won't Wei WuXian have no body," that's just tough beans for Wei WuXian! This ain't about him!*It's ten seconds after Mo XuanYu was supposed to die. Instead, he blinks blearily up at the ghost strolling towards him. 'Shit,' he thinks, 'I'm in trouble now.'$f$, 2822, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2019-11-03T20:32:09.630+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-03T20:32:09.655+00:00$f$, $f$2019-06-29T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
