($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 19404262, $f$Bubble Tea$f$, ARRAY[$f$OngNiel9596$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Wei Wuxian is a bubble tea fanatic.But that was fine. Bubble tea helped him get Lan Wangji after all.$f$, 4122, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-11-04T12:45:06.710+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-04T12:45:06.758+00:00$f$, $f$2019-06-29T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 19413058, $f$as he pleases$f$, ARRAY[$f$thecelestialcow$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$“I’m not that smart,” Mo Xuanyu says with a laugh. 
Xue Yang lays a hand on his shoulder, pushing him back so that he can climb on top of him, kissing him possessively. 
“No, you’re not,” Xue Yang murmurs. “But you’re still mine.” 
Mo Xuanyu’s body warms at that. It should be frightening, but it only makes Mo Xuanyu feel cared for, especially since he knows Xue Yang isn’t good with words and social niceties. He says what he feels and Mo Xuanyu admires how blunt he is, how he can just say what’s on his mind.$f$, 4079, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2019-11-03T17:06:43.812+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-03T17:06:43.838+00:00$f$, $f$2019-06-30T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 19420699, $f$Reverse Mode$f$, ARRAY[$f$Sath$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$人渣反派自救系统 - 墨香铜臭 | The Scum Villain's Self-Saving System - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$“You know what gets me hot?” Shen Qingqiu said, immediately cringing at what he’d said. It was the wine! 
Even in the dark, Shen Qingqiu could see that Luo Binghe’s eyes were shining. “What, Shizun?” 
Oh no, Shen Qingqiu couldn’t say it. He was drunk, but not that drunk! As he stared up at Luo Binghe, he realized that he either had to lie and come up with something boring (“Your congee makes me horny,” Shen Qingqiu could say) or tell the truth. Because… he really wanted it right now.$f$, 2051, 1, 1, true, 5, false, $f$2019-08-17T02:51:45.068+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-17T02:51:45.100+00:00$f$, $f$2019-06-30T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
