($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 19739968, $f$Gold Amidst Snow$f$, ARRAY[$f$ClearAutumnVibes$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$人渣反派自救系统 - 墨香铜臭 | The Scum Villain's Self-Saving System - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Jin Guangyao dies and hopes that the next life is kinder on him. Sadly it was not meant to be when he's reincarnated as Shen Jiu, the slave of the Qiu family. This time, he vows, he'll do better and learn from past mistakes. But when all he sees around him are the ghosts of the past, regrets pile up and even he isn't sure he can keep up that charade. Cue Liu Qingge who finds out about his sordid past life and vows to help the man who saved his life.$f$, 9769, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-11-03T14:12:55.829+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-03T14:12:55.866+00:00$f$, $f$2019-07-09T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 19744105, $f$Дурная слава$f$, ARRAY[$f$Ginger_Elle$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$В Башне Кои Вэй Ин встречает тех, кто был близко знаком с его телом, когда то ещё принадлежало Мо Сюяньюю. Пытаясь объяснить Лань Ванцзи, что произошло, Вэй Ин объясняет тому кое-что другое.Таймлайн главы 47.$f$, 4205, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-11-30T18:48:54.231+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-30T18:48:54.262+00:00$f$, $f$2019-07-09T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 19751920, $f$dearest san lang$f$, ARRAY[$f$gintokitas$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$天官赐福 - 墨香铜臭 | Tiān Guān Cì Fú - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$“This is perfectly fine,” Xie Lian whispers to himself as he nervously paces around his room. One hand holds tightly onto a thin package of tights while the other hand is curled into a fist at his side. The packaged tights are black and sheer, conveniently matching Hua Cheng’s general weight and height group. He would love to say he had no idea what possessed him to buy them at the department store earlier, but that would a big ol’ blatant lie.
♡
in which xie lian is big horny thinking about hua cheng wearing tights$f$, 3779, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-10-09T11:50:47.335+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-09T11:50:47.359+00:00$f$, $f$2019-07-10T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 19756339, $f$Conquered$f$, ARRAY[$f$Anonymous$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Original Work$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$He had seen forty winters, and he’d led armies into battle during the Reclamations. So yes – he’d seen some things in his time. Perhaps he should have suspected. Perhaps he should have known.
  But fact of the matter is – he didn’t. Not at all. Not until their wedding night and they were alone in the royal bedchamber.
  Not until the blushing virgin bride he’d just taken to wife before God tried to stab him through the heart.$f$, 1234, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2019-08-09T04:17:29.707+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-09T04:17:29.761+00:00$f$, $f$2019-07-11T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
