($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 19811593, $f$A warm welcome$f$, ARRAY[$f$Starishadow$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Frowning, the Sect Leader lowered his arm, letting the tiny paper man get on the palm of his hand, and then bringing it close to his face, carefully looking at it. «A-Yu?», he asked then, in a soft voice, smiling a bit. The tiny paper man seemed to nod at that, jumping a bit in triumph.Huaisang chuckled and shook his head, carefully patting the tiny thing on the head with the tip of his finger:«Didn’t your Sect Leader tell you not to use this dangerous technique until you got better at controlling it?».
After a minor accident during his training as a demonic cultivator, Mo Xuanyu is sent to Qinghe to rest and recover. But, of course, YilingWei Sect disciples have never been famous for easily following orders...$f$, 3914, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2019-11-01T14:19:47.339+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-01T14:19:47.378+00:00$f$, $f$2019-07-15T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
