($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 19847392, $f$Lost in Diplomacy$f$, ARRAY[$f$Subtleladybird$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$A spark of conflict was ready to ignite the fire of war, and the shadow of an ambitious dynasty loomed over the world; leaving kingdoms scrambling for allies in preparation for an uncertain future. It was a sparkle that burned the order of their lives, their worlds crumbling around them, leaving them with no escape, taking away any semblance of peace. They were left stranded in a cruel world, their lives dictated by fate and destiny. Their future ordained by uncertainty. Wei Wuxian could only comply and accept his fortune of marrying into the Lan Dynasty as the Empress of the righteous, Lan Wangji. He was prepared for a lonely and dull life, so why was he seeking to capture the attention of the boring and unyielding Jade Emperor?$f$, 67955, 15, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-10-23T13:22:19.770+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-23T13:22:19.795+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-18T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 19859719, $f$to long for something that will not return$f$, ARRAY[$f$arahir$f$, $f$Pomyluna$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Fatherhood isn't easy. Lan Wangji does his best.

  “It's a song for asking questions.”
  “Oh. Asking who?”
  “...The dead.”
  The boy shuffles back and forth and then reaches out as if he’s going to pluck a string before he pulls back his hand. Lan Wangji holds it out to him in offer and he makes one hesitant note with his little finger before he asks, “Who died?”$f$, 2409, 1, 1, true, 5, false, $f$2019-10-21T22:16:47.743+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-21T22:16:47.776+00:00$f$, $f$2019-07-19T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 19859878, $f$fire and other things you shouldn't trust$f$, ARRAY[$f$arahir$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Wei Wuxian is teacher of the year.
  “What are you doing?” Jin Ling asks, against his better judgment.
  “Shortening the fuse,” Wei Wuxian says after a moment, implying both that there is a fuse long enough to be shortened and that this is a thing anyone would want to do.
  “I don’t think that’s—”
  “Jin Ling. Please. He’s an expert.”$f$, 5840, 1, 1, true, 5, false, $f$2019-10-22T11:31:13.612+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-22T11:31:13.640+00:00$f$, $f$2019-07-24T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 19865437, $f$A break$f$, ARRAY[$f$IndigoVoice$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Lo único que deseaba era escapar, incluso si era tan solo por un día. De cualquier forma su difunta madre no lloraría ninguna de las ropas que iba a tomar.
"Un respiro, sólo necesito un respiro."$f$, 313, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-11-30T18:47:28.231+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-30T18:47:28.254+00:00$f$, $f$2019-07-18T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 19865569, $f$Goodbye.$f$, ARRAY[$f$IndigoVoice$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Aquella fue la última vez que vió a dos de las personas más importantes de su vida. Incluso a veces se preguntaba "¿Qué pensarían de mi si me vieran ahora?"Entonces comenzaría a reír como un desquiciado mientras las personas  se apartaban como si portara la peste. No era necesario pensar: Demente.$f$, 603, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-11-30T18:47:25.915+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-30T18:47:25.947+00:00$f$, $f$2019-07-18T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 19879426, $f$blight$f$, ARRAY[$f$eniwhere_but_here$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Mo Xuanyu learns of the Head Shaker's grudge against his brother. He has no hard feelings.$f$, 100, 1, 1, true, 3, false, $f$2019-11-30T18:47:09.443+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-30T18:47:09.476+00:00$f$, $f$2019-07-20T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 19885624, $f$MDZS Drabble Trash Can$f$, ARRAY[$f$backspacedintooblivion (Evil_and_I_know_it)$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$, $f$魔道祖师 | Módào Zǔshī (Cartoon)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$A series of drabbles from the MDZS universe. Tags, summaries and relationships will be updated with every drabble! Most of them will stand alone, but some will have continuations :31.“A-Ying knows A-Than’s house! Mommy confused A-Ying!”“Okay, you brat.” She set Wei Ying down and smoothened his hair. “Be good for gege and I’ll come pick you up at five, okay?”Wei Ying nodded and kissed her on the cheek, before barrelling past Xichen screaming for his A-Than.$f$, 14098, 19, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-12-08T16:21:35.702+00:00$f$, $f$2019-12-08T16:21:35.712+00:00$f$, $f$2019-12-08T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 19890529, $f$and the world was gone$f$, ARRAY[$f$chiqi$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$The sun was shining, made honey glisten. Nie Huaisang wouldn’t cry with Mo Xuanyu—such a sight lived only in dreams. But the glitters were different. There was no joy in his smile, no crinkle met his steady gaze.$f$, 2370, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2019-11-03T12:38:40.652+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-03T12:38:40.680+00:00$f$, $f$2019-07-21T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 19898476, $f$Taking Care$f$, ARRAY[$f$Sath$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$人渣反派自救系统 - 墨香铜臭 | The Scum Villain's Self-Saving System - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$“You did what?” Yue Qingyuan asked. “It’s what we normally do,” the An Ding Peak disciple replied. “When two people get hit by succubi poison we just… stick them in a room together until they work things out. I’m sorry, but you really shouldn’t be here, even as a head disciple.” “But Liu Qingge and Shen Qingqiu? Do you want one of them to come out dead?”$f$, 2199, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2019-08-17T02:58:48.942+00:00$f$, $f$2019-08-17T02:58:48.969+00:00$f$, $f$2019-07-21T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 19951834, $f$The sufferings of Meng Yao$f$, ARRAY[$f$tothemovies (jarofactonbell)$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$How to get through your 20s, in tact - a guide by Meng Yao:1. Don't have a lousy family who insist who ruining your life and hide Important Life Events from you, at any given moment2. Definitely do not have children. Don't take in kids, don't birth kids, don't indefinitely foster kids because you will love them and keep them forever3. Avoid rescuing the collapsed man on the outcrop of a cliff face and definitely close your doors if you do, he'll stay in your house, rip his shirt, cook you food and steal your heart4. Never pine for a short time. You are below that. Pull a six year pining concert gig. Solo your dramatic soliloquies to your brother's Twitter followers( 4.5 - Please don't chase storms in vague recollection of a pair of eyes. You Will Actually Die)5. Deny yourself happiness and nice things because you are a Big Coward6. Put away Jin Guangyao for weekdays and be Meng Yao in your free timeGood luck. You'll need it$f$, 17345, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2019-11-03T16:50:38.093+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-03T16:50:38.114+00:00$f$, $f$2019-07-24T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 19969546, $f$here we go again$f$, ARRAY[$f$magnvseffect$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$“So, let me get this straight,” Jin Ling says slowly. “You found the guy you think is your dad, looked up his family's company, read their entire website, made a new email to write to them like you were an actual advertiser for the hotel and now they're having their company holidays here?”When put like that, it certainly sounds more convoluted (and borderline crazy) than Wei Yuan intended it to be. “...Yes?”or, wei yuan's plan to (hopefully) meet his biological father backfires in the best way possible.$f$, 3703, 1, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-11-30T23:42:50.165+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-30T23:42:50.183+00:00$f$, $f$2019-07-25T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 19971172, $f$someday the dream will end$f$, ARRAY[$f$flwerpath$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$魔道祖师 - 墨香铜臭 | Módào Zǔshī - Mòxiāng Tóngxiù$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$In a world where peace and calm is never sure, Summoner Lan Wangji finally begins his pilgrimage meeting new friends, guardians, and along the way, the ones he once lost.$f$, 18854, 4, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2019-11-03T16:53:10.360+00:00$f$, $f$2019-11-03T16:53:10.383+00:00$f$, $f$2019-10-06T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
